discimagestudio-gui is an independent Linux GUI frontend for
DiscImageStudio. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
upstream DiscImageStudio project.

Upstream project: DiscImageStudio by JiaFeiMiao-K-Cat
(https://github.com/JiaFeiMiao-K-Cat/DiscImageStudio), licensed
under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

This frontend contains no upstream code. It drives the official
DiscImageStudio command-line program as a subprocess (solve /
simulate / selftest) and renders none of the disc mathematics
itself. Calibration drives the separate disc-probe tool, also as
a subprocess.

